OL,3,GNEWSA'I lost my NHS job of 28 years and
OL,4,Abecame a baker'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS worker says redundancy after 28
OL,7,Fyears of service was a "blessing", as
OL,8,Fit enabled her to pursue her dream of
OL,9,Fbecoming a baker.
OL,11,FTracey Hayes, from Nuneaton,
OL,12,FWarwickshire, lost her job as a
OL,13,Fcytology screener at University
OL,14,FHospitals Coventry & Warwickshire in
OL,15,F2020.
OL,17,FShe now sells wedding, birthday and
OL,18,FChristmas cakes, along with other baked
OL,19,Fgoods, after receiving business support
OL,20,Ffrom a programme run by a Christian
OL,21,Forganisation. "I always had a passion
OL,22,Ffor baking," she said.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
