OL,3,GNEWSA'I lost my NHS job of 28 years and
OL,4,Abecame a baker'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn her former job, Hayes examined cells
OL,7,Fas part of the cervical screening
OL,8,Fprocess. Changes to testing meant fewer
OL,9,Fsamples needed screening, and her role
OL,10,Fwas "scaled down".
